  "title": "Butterscotch Bars",
  "description": "Enjoy the wonderful butterscotch flavor and satisfying crunch of pecans in these Butterscotch Bars, cleverly made with Duncan Hines French Vanilla Cake Mix. It&#39;s easy, tasty and fun to share.",
